    <h3>3. Orders &amp; Payments</h3>
    <p>By placing an order through this website, you confirm that the details you provide (name, phone, delivery address) are accurate, and that the funds used for payment are lawfully yours. Product prices are shown in Indian Rupees (&#8377;) and are re-verified against our records at the time your order is placed. Please see our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Return Policy</a> for details on cancellations, returns and payment issues.</p>

